---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { SITE } from "../lib/site";
import {
    aboutPageSchema,
    jsonLdGraph,
    personSchema,
} from "../lib/structured-data";
---

<Layout
    title="about"
    description={SITE.aboutDescription}
    jsonLd={jsonLdGraph(aboutPageSchema(), personSchema())}
>
    <h1>about</h1>
    <p>
        I am Crystal (he/him). I spend most of my time experimenting with anything that catches
        my curiosity. I find computers, the universe, and spacecraft
        fascinating. I like many different things and sometimes have trouble
        choosing what to focus on.
    </p>
    <p>
        I code whenever I get a random idea or need to solve a problem. I am also into homelabbing. Right now, I am
        learning to draw and self-studying Japanese.
    </p>
    <p>
        In my free time, I play games. Recently, I have been playing CS2,
        Wuthering Waves, ETS 2, and NieR: Automata. I also got into aim training
        and have been playing KovaaK's, mostly Viscose's Benchmark. I am on
        Steam at <a href={SITE.steam} target="_blank" rel="me noopener noreferrer">crysoid</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
        I daily drive Linux. I’m mostly on Arch Linux, but I also use Fedora
        frequently. KDE is my preferred desktop environment.
    </p>
</Layout>
